ought it was intentional. `Color.hex`, `Color.hex64`, `Color.html`, `Color.from_rgb9995`, `Color(code, alpha)`.\r\nDo they all need to be supported in this PR? Since they aren't as common I figured they could be added later, if wanted.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847311603/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847511040","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105724#issuecomment-2847511040","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105724","id":2847511040,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6puZIA","user":{"login":"dugramen","id":54819319,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODE5MzE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54819319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen","html_url":"https://github.com/dugramen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T15:33:57Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T15:33:57Z","body":"I have an updated commit ready for all kitbdev's fixes, but my wifi is out so I'll have to push tomorrow or something\n\n> There is another syntax supported for Colors, but it's probably the least used - integer colors, e.g. Color(0xff0000ff).\n\nThe way I have it set up now, the used syntax is just whatever tab is selected in the color picker, and if the hex toggle is enabled it uses a hex string. But that limits it to just those 4 constructors.\n\nWould it be better to just ignore the tab, and instead repurpose the hex button to cycle between all the constructors. I think vscode does that","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847511040/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847638337","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105724#issuecomment-2847638337","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105724","id":2847638337,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pu4NB","user":{"login":"dugramen","id":54819319,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODE5MzE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54819319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen","html_url":"https://github.com/dugramen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T16:30:42Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T16:39:57Z","body":"Alright wifi came back. Summary of fixes:\r\n- Switched to using dictionaries (willing to switch back if arrays are better for performance)\r\n- Fixed drawing bugs, and added transparent checker image for translucent colors\r\n- Prevent functions that end with \"color\" from showing a color button\n- Draw selection background for objects\r\n- Changed cursor to pointer when hovering an object\r\n\r\n> If this is called when the picker is already open, it gets called before _picker_closed and causes the symbol tooltip on hover to stay off.\r\n\r\nIt seems that ScriptTextEditor already forces hover tooltip to enabled anyways (not based on some setting like I thought), so I got rid of `previous_tooltip_enabled` and just enabled / disabled it when the popup opens / closes","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847638337/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849727950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105724#issuecomment-2849727950","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105724","id":2849727950,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p22XO","user":{"login":"dugramen","id":54819319,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODE5MzE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54819319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen","html_url":"https://github.com/dugramen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-05T01:51:44Z","updated_at":"2025-05-05T01:51:44Z","body":"Ok new commit implementing the fixes, and added support for hex integers. \r\n\r\nI changed it so that you now choose a constructor from a dropdown, rather than it being tied to which tab the color picker is on. This enables any number of constructors in the future. I also simplified the code a bit to make adding & reordering constructors easier. Here's a demo:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95d64146-2143-4519-ba20-c2fbdb8ea116\r\n\r\nAlso after testing more while considering word wrap, I found a few bugs relating to object hover / click position, so had to rework that a bit. The weird indentation offset code is just how its calculated in other places too","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2849727950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880536854","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105724#issuecomment-2880536854","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105724","id":2880536854,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rsYEW","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https